    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.poster.avif?t=1754347139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.webm?t=1754347139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.mp4?t=1754347139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>CraftCraft is made by a small fully indie studio who made Death and Taxes.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Become a jeweler or a smith in a quaint port town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Create a moth / elf / cat character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  \u2727 Meet a lot of different folks and impact their lives. Your choices matter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Have a cute owlcat as a pet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Relax and craft! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Make <i>shiny</i> stuff.\u00a0\u2727 \u22c6 \u02d9 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Make even MORE <i>shiny</i> stuff.\u00a0\u22c6 \u02d9 \u2727 +\u00a0* \u00a0\u02d9 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2727 Make less <i>shiny</i> and more <strong>ominous</strong> stuff.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Includes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Full voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Short branching story spanning 11 in game days.\u00a0About 5-8 hours to finish the game once. (+ a non-story endless mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  \u2727 Replayability (multiple backgrounds with unique characters tied to it, some random scavangables and multiple endings). <br> <br>\u2727 Original soundtrack using real folk instruments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Completely unique crafting simulation </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.poster.avif?t=1754347139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.webm?t=1754347139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.mp4?t=1754347139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>CraftCraft is made by a small fully indie studio who made Death and Taxes.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Become a jeweler or a smith in a quaint port town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Create a moth / elf / cat character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  \u2727 Meet a lot of different folks and impact their lives. Your choices matter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Have a cute owlcat as a pet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Relax and craft! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Make <i>shiny</i> stuff.\u00a0\u2727 \u22c6 \u02d9 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Make even MORE <i>shiny</i> stuff.\u00a0\u22c6 \u02d9 \u2727 +\u00a0* \u00a0\u02d9 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2727 Make less <i>shiny</i> and more <strong>ominous</strong> stuff.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Includes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Full voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Short branching story spanning 11 in game days.\u00a0About 5-8 hours to finish the game once. (+ a non-story endless mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  \u2727 Replayability (multiple backgrounds with unique characters tied to it, some random scavangables and multiple endings). <br> <br>\u2727 Original soundtrack using real folk instruments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2727 Completely unique crafting simulation </p>",
    "short_description": "CraftCraft is a story-based RPG merchant sim with hands on crafting! Create a pretty necklace for a mermaid or a sword made of dragon blood! Be a Moth or an Elf or a Cat and express your creativity in your cozy crafting studio and change the lives of locals in the mysterious port town of Windspell.",
